   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Green = accepted (8 edges = n-1). Red X = skipped (cycle).\nEvery vertex starts as its own island; each taken edge MERGES two islands.",
   "fontSize": 16,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "originalText": "Green = accepted (8 edges = n-1). Red X = skipped (cycle).\nEvery vertex starts as its own island; each taken edge MERGES two islands.",
